@startuml
' Figure 32.3  On-behalf-of delegation
' Reading order: top to bottom. The harness exchanges the customer's
' session for a run token naming the customer, the agent and the run;
' the gateway checks it on each call and the broker inside it fills
' the system-of-record key. The run never holds a key.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Harness" as H <<model>>
participant "Control\nplane" as CP <<policy>>
participant "Gateway\nand broker" as G <<policy>>
participant "Payments" as P <<ops>>
H -> CP : Session and\nagent
CP --> H : Run token
H -> G : Call, token,\npermission
G -> G : Token checks
G -> P : Key filled
P --> G : Accepted
G --> H : Result,\nno key
@enduml
